      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diamond_Creek",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ellis Cottage, a rubble‑stone hipped‑roof house, survives with its original fabric and is listed on the Victorian Heritage database.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
